   "dockerFinding": "inside a plain docker container (only cap_add NET_ADMIN, like deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml) bwrap fails: default seccomp/apparmor -> 'No permissions to create new namespace'; seccomp=unconfined -> 'Failed to make / slave: Permission denied'; seccomp+apparmor unconfined -> works with --tmpfs /proc (procMode 'tmpfs'). So verify_exec fails closed (VERIFY_EXEC_UNAVAILABLE) on the current production compose until security_opt seccomp:unconfined + apparmor:unconfined (and unprivileged userns allowed) are added.",
